WEBVTT

00:06.370 --> 00:11.530
In the distant future, if I end up
turning into something else entirely,

00:11.530 --> 00:14.660
I want you to kill me with your Demon Sword.

00:15.870 --> 00:18.160
When the time comes, you must remember.

00:18.160 --> 00:21.040
My request, your duty...

00:21.540 --> 00:25.420
And... remember to find the REAL me.

00:26.330 --> 00:31.550
I have no doubt that the Demon Sword I gave you
will guide you to your fate.

00:38.250 --> 00:39.310
Leo!

00:40.000 --> 00:42.070
That's what Roselia said back then...

00:42.920 --> 00:44.820
...to find the real her.

00:45.420 --> 00:47.320
That's the duty I was given.

00:48.150 --> 00:52.040
And if this Demon Sword is meant
to guide me to my fate,

00:52.040 --> 00:56.200
then using it to strike the real Roselia
should be impossible.

00:57.250 --> 01:00.080
That fake Goddess must be abolished.

01:01.210 --> 01:03.200
And until I find the real Roselia...

01:05.580 --> 01:08.160
...defeat is not an option.

02:42.250 --> 02:44.330
THE TRUTH BEHIND THE DEMON SWORD

02:45.060 --> 02:46.780
Are you okay?

02:47.330 --> 02:50.170
My wounds healed after you shared your blood with me.

02:50.170 --> 02:51.850
It saved my life.

02:52.330 --> 02:56.250
Riselia has absorbed my mana-infused blood
multiple times now.

02:56.250 --> 03:01.280
Having that blood returned to me must have been the
trigger that unlocked those memories sealed within me.

03:01.280 --> 03:04.080
Glad to have you back with us, milord!

03:04.080 --> 03:06.620
Please take some time to rest and recover.

03:06.620 --> 03:10.250
We shall clean up the riffraff for you!

03:10.540 --> 03:11.580
Miss Selia.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.920
Could you give me some of the lining from your dress?

03:13.920 --> 03:15.620
I'm going to mend my clothes.

03:15.620 --> 03:16.210
Sure.

03:21.750 --> 03:22.750
Will this do?

03:22.750 --> 03:23.180
Yes.

03:33.920 --> 03:36.790
I'm going to vanquish that Void Lord for sure this time.

03:36.790 --> 03:38.480
Please back me up.

03:38.480 --> 03:39.410
Right!

03:42.960 --> 03:47.540
Although my power has waned a little bit,
I haven't exhausted my mana just yet.

03:47.540 --> 03:49.830
So I should be able to unleash that attack one more time.

03:49.830 --> 03:52.500
Please make use of our souls.

03:53.370 --> 03:58.170
You can convert our souls into
an energy source with your sorcery powers.

03:58.170 --> 03:59.780
Isn't that right?

04:00.800 --> 04:03.040
Based on what I've seen...

04:03.040 --> 04:08.100
I'm certain you are an individual of outstanding talent
who is capable of more than just performing sorcery.

04:08.370 --> 04:09.790
Can you do it, Leo?

04:09.790 --> 04:11.520
Yes. I can.

04:11.830 --> 04:16.860
If we knights aren't enough, then you can include the
souls of all the citizens here who met an untimely death.

04:17.170 --> 04:20.780
They also wish for a chance to exact retribution.

04:22.500 --> 04:24.080
I get it now.

04:24.080 --> 04:29.700
It was the influence of Tearis and her resurrection ability
that gave the souls of these knights an astral form.

04:29.700 --> 04:33.370
And after she fully awakened, the impact grew stronger,

04:33.370 --> 04:38.040
causing even the souls of the people from the city
to begin wandering around as ghosts.

04:38.500 --> 04:42.490
We beseech you to grant us this one last wish.

04:43.460 --> 04:44.710
Very well.

04:44.710 --> 04:47.170
I will assume responsibility for all of your souls.

04:47.170 --> 04:49.350
And see your wishes through to the end.

04:49.870 --> 04:52.500
O, ye who wander through the darkness.

04:52.500 --> 04:55.250
Ye who are bound by relentless spite.

04:55.250 --> 04:57.170
Cometh, all ye lost souls.

04:57.170 --> 05:01.540
Let my power grow through thine assemblage,
and accepteth thy fleeting fate.

05:01.540 --> 05:03.280
Soray Guila!

05:12.080 --> 05:13.370
Thank you, sir!

05:13.370 --> 05:15.790
It is time. We shall join as well.

05:16.170 --> 05:17.500
Please wait.

05:17.500 --> 05:20.420
I have a more suitable job for you gentlemen.

05:21.040 --> 05:25.780
O, loyal soldiers of the underworld...
gather now at my encampment!

05:42.040 --> 05:42.860
Incredible!

05:42.860 --> 05:44.120
Thank you.

05:45.370 --> 05:46.900
We can fight again!

05:48.290 --> 05:50.620
Miss Selia. Please lead them in battle.

05:50.620 --> 05:52.580
Huh? You want me to be the leader?

05:52.580 --> 05:56.410
It's going to take some time for me
to gather enough energy in the Demon Sword.

05:56.750 --> 05:59.500
And I will be absolutely defenseless during that period.

06:00.290 --> 06:03.500
That's what it will take for us to defeat the Void Lord.

06:03.500 --> 06:06.380
So I'm leaving my life in your hands, Miss Selia.

06:07.920 --> 06:09.220
All right!

06:20.040 --> 06:21.960
Well now, can't let the rookies outshine us!

06:21.960 --> 06:24.150
I haven't been this riled up in a long time!

06:24.420 --> 06:27.240
I shall lend you a helping hand!

06:31.570 --> 06:36.200
Brave knights of House Crystalia... follow my lead!

06:36.750 --> 06:37.700
Right!

06:46.590 --> 06:48.260
We're good to go. Hop on!

06:48.260 --> 06:49.040
Roger!

06:49.040 --> 06:49.680
Okay!

06:49.680 --> 06:50.620
Wait!

06:53.460 --> 06:56.570
You're going to where the fighting is, right?
Take me with you.

06:57.060 --> 07:00.650
But you're injured...
It would be better if you stayed hidden.

07:01.000 --> 07:01.560
Look out!

07:06.960 --> 07:09.370
Those are the enemies I am sworn to defeat.

07:10.710 --> 07:13.740
My sword... the Demon Lord Slayer
has the power to do it.

07:15.250 --> 07:19.410
You're willing to put everything on the line. Aren't you?

07:20.420 --> 07:23.670
Finé! Let's take Arle with us.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.840
If things get dicey, I'll keep her safe.

07:26.290 --> 07:28.510
All right. We'll go together.

07:28.510 --> 07:29.490
Hurry now!

07:30.790 --> 07:34.050
I promise not to cause you ladies any trouble.

07:35.750 --> 07:37.060
Aim for their heads!

07:54.000 --> 07:56.280
We can't let the mistress do all the work!

07:59.330 --> 08:01.540
You don't have to tell me!

08:07.590 --> 08:10.070
Like I figured, this will require time...

08:18.310 --> 08:22.450
I'll take control of the bike with Eye of the Witch,
so just focus on shooting them down, Regina!

08:23.080 --> 08:24.560
Roger that!

08:24.560 --> 08:27.160
Activate: Drag Howl!

08:40.370 --> 08:42.000
They're weak on the right flank!

08:42.000 --> 08:42.960
Echelon formation!

08:43.620 --> 08:44.450
Yes ma'am!

08:54.170 --> 08:55.170
Thank you!

08:55.170 --> 08:55.840
Don't mention it.

08:55.840 --> 08:58.220
Keep your guard up, Mistress!

08:58.220 --> 08:59.460
Of course!

08:59.460 --> 09:04.640
Your Vampire Queen powers are most formidable,
but you mustn't rely on them for everything.

09:04.640 --> 09:09.480
You're right. It's just that this dress
is taking a heavier toll than I expected.

09:10.360 --> 09:13.780
But even so... I won't go back to being
the powerless girl I was 6 years ago!

09:14.400 --> 09:16.990
Leo entrusted me with his life.

09:17.500 --> 09:20.830
So I have to risk my own! And keep him safe!

09:21.170 --> 09:23.420
That's the spirit!

09:23.420 --> 09:27.460
I'm also willing to accept this place
as my grave if it comes down to it!

09:28.710 --> 09:31.500
No better place for a warrior to die than in battle!

09:31.500 --> 09:36.220
What are you boneheads going on about?
We're already skeletons that died a long time ago!

09:36.630 --> 09:38.930
Oh quit being such a wet blanket!

09:44.330 --> 09:45.370
Leo...

10:05.330 --> 10:06.540
That's not good!

10:06.540 --> 10:09.420
I still need more time to gather enough energy!

10:20.370 --> 10:22.180
Incoming! Everybody run for it!

10:22.180 --> 10:23.180
Scatter!

10:23.180 --> 10:23.870
Yes ma'am!

10:46.210 --> 10:47.250
Leo!

10:47.250 --> 10:48.280
It's okay.

10:49.170 --> 10:50.700
Just a little more now!

10:53.670 --> 10:55.370
Selia? Selia?

10:55.880 --> 10:57.670
I can't get through.

10:57.670 --> 10:59.620
Do you think they're okay?

11:00.290 --> 11:01.510
All we can do is hope.

11:02.370 --> 11:03.700
Still too far away.

11:04.750 --> 11:08.310
I need to conserve as much of my strength as possible
until we're within striking distance.

11:14.540 --> 11:15.990
Obstruction ahead!

11:17.610 --> 11:18.420
We're jumping over it!

11:18.420 --> 11:19.650
Are you serious?!

11:19.650 --> 11:21.780
Thrusters active!

11:30.210 --> 11:30.830
It's huge!

11:30.830 --> 11:32.040
We can't evade it!

11:32.040 --> 11:33.380
Damn monster!

11:48.960 --> 11:52.450
Here I was thinking I had found a toy
that could entertain me for awhile.

11:53.040 --> 11:58.740
But seeing as how I'm the loyal maid
of the great Demon Lord... it just wasn't a match for me.

12:30.540 --> 12:32.790
The black moon has now reached its zenith.

12:32.790 --> 12:36.040
O, spirits of the dead!
Lend thyselves to my Demon Sword!

12:36.040 --> 12:39.410
And become free from the chains that bind thy souls!

12:47.660 --> 12:50.920
It's casting a third widespread destruction spell?!

12:50.920 --> 12:52.200
Not on my watch!

13:13.670 --> 13:14.560
What?!

13:14.560 --> 13:15.850
I'm on it!

13:30.490 --> 13:34.580
Thou art the blade bestowed by the Heavens,
meant to save the world.

13:34.580 --> 13:40.000
Thou art the blade forged to rebel against the Heavens,
meant to destroy the world.

13:40.000 --> 13:43.380
A sacred blade, blessed by the gods.

13:43.380 --> 13:46.470
A wicked blade, blessed by a goddess.

13:46.870 --> 13:49.390
With thee at my side, I shall bring my enemies to ruin.

13:50.040 --> 13:52.200
And thy name, fallen to Darkness, is...

13:52.810 --> 13:55.480
...the Demon Sword, Dáinsleif!

14:00.360 --> 14:02.940
A high grade Holy Protection spell?!

14:06.070 --> 14:09.240
Whatever, I can't stop now!

14:13.870 --> 14:14.830
There it is!

14:14.830 --> 14:16.540
Obstruction ahead!

14:16.540 --> 14:17.870
Not another one...

14:18.370 --> 14:20.500
I don't think jumping is gonna work this time!

14:21.170 --> 14:22.660
Just stay on course!

14:26.500 --> 14:28.010
Finé! Do what she says!

14:28.540 --> 14:29.500
Hang on tight!

14:29.500 --> 14:31.910
We'll use maximum power to shoot straight
over the pole shaft!

14:34.870 --> 14:36.140
Holy Sword mode shift!

14:36.580 --> 14:38.200
Drag Blaster!

14:50.030 --> 14:51.160
TAKE THIS!

14:53.530 --> 14:54.950
Goddess of Rebellion!

14:55.460 --> 14:56.950
Roselia Ishtaris!

14:57.540 --> 15:00.210
I'm going to obliterate you!

15:05.210 --> 15:06.090
It veered to the side?!

15:08.930 --> 15:10.220
Who just did that?!

15:18.870 --> 15:23.240
Turning your weapons against the Goddess
is a grave sin that shall not go unpunished!

15:25.610 --> 15:27.990
My Demon Sword knows the truth!

15:28.790 --> 15:30.370
You're nothing but a fake!

15:30.870 --> 15:31.950
MEET YOUR DEMISE!

15:48.420 --> 15:53.700
The Demon Lord will appear in our world
when we need him most to defeat the Voids for us.

16:25.040 --> 16:26.250
Milady.

16:27.830 --> 16:31.370
A knight's greatest pride is fighting
by their master's side in the end.

16:31.370 --> 16:33.630
We have no regrets left now.

16:33.960 --> 16:38.350
Are you going to the afterlife?
Where my father, mother, and all my sisters are?

16:38.350 --> 16:40.920
I realize it will be lonely.

16:40.920 --> 16:46.450
But you must stay here, milady. Please see the duty
of House Crystalia through to the end.

16:46.940 --> 16:51.860
I will. I promise to keep fighting for you
and everyone else!

16:51.860 --> 16:56.200
We wish you the best and pray
for your continued success.

16:58.120 --> 17:00.370
Lady Selia!

17:00.370 --> 17:00.870
Regina?!

17:01.210 --> 17:02.250
Selia?

17:02.250 --> 17:03.370
Say something if you can hear me!

17:03.370 --> 17:04.620
Fare thee well.

17:04.620 --> 17:05.750
Over here!

17:04.620 --> 17:05.750
Lady Selia!

17:05.750 --> 17:07.530
Regina! Finé!

17:09.250 --> 17:10.880
Lady Selia!

17:10.880 --> 17:11.960
You guys!

17:11.960 --> 17:14.010
I'm so glad that you're okay!

17:14.540 --> 17:16.530
We all managed to survive somehow.

17:17.120 --> 17:18.760
Including this girl who we took in.

17:18.760 --> 17:20.540
She kicked serious butt.

17:20.540 --> 17:23.770
All the fighting wiped her out,
but she's the one who defeated that Void Lord.

17:40.040 --> 17:42.330
Riselia Crystalia! What a relief!

17:43.250 --> 17:45.000
Hurry it up, medic team!

17:45.000 --> 17:47.910
Checking the vitals of everyone
on the investigation team is your top priority!

17:58.920 --> 18:03.870
That's one mystery solved. It must have been her attack
that shattered the Holy Protection spell.

18:04.420 --> 18:08.650
But what exactly is the Elf Hero doing in this era...?

18:13.190 --> 18:16.200
What's the matter, Leo? You've got a frown on your face.

18:16.200 --> 18:18.450
Oh! It's nothing.

18:20.040 --> 18:21.330
What is that?

18:21.330 --> 18:24.580
It's a fairy tale book that I found in my father's study.

18:25.120 --> 18:28.210
Or at least I thought so. But I was wrong.

18:28.210 --> 18:34.830
Anyway, my father would always have this book open in
front of him when he read me the fairy tale.

18:34.830 --> 18:36.710
What kind of story was it?

18:36.710 --> 18:38.220
It was all about a Demon Lord.

18:39.640 --> 18:44.500
The Demon Lord lived in a castle of bones
and would ride a skeletal horse around

18:44.500 --> 18:46.790
while commanding a legion of skeletons.

18:46.790 --> 18:51.520
Then he would do things like make lighting rain
from the skies and shoot fire from his mouth.

18:51.520 --> 18:53.480
But he doesn't shoot fire from his mouth!

18:53.750 --> 18:57.370
The Demon Lord in my father's story
always breathed fire...

18:57.370 --> 18:59.290
Besides, how would you know that it's not true?

18:59.290 --> 19:03.570
Uh, no reason! It just seemed off to me, that's all...

19:04.540 --> 19:05.370
Oh yeah?

19:05.710 --> 19:09.240
It's nothing but a silly fairy tale,
but interesting nonetheless.

19:10.040 --> 19:13.710
Although the true legend of the Demon Lord
and the Gods is no longer passed down,

19:13.710 --> 19:16.070
these childish tales might be the enduring remains of it.

19:16.630 --> 19:20.430
Actually, you remind me a little
of the Demon Lord from the story.

19:20.750 --> 19:21.760
Huh?!

19:23.210 --> 19:25.410
Fire doesn't shoot out of my mouth, okay?

19:26.420 --> 19:27.140
I guess not!

19:27.140 --> 19:31.070
By the way, what happens
to the Demon Lord at the end of the story?

19:31.620 --> 19:35.620
The Hero defeats the Demon Lord like usual.
Then everybody lives happily ever after.

19:37.000 --> 19:38.210
That's utter trash.

19:38.210 --> 19:38.960
What?

19:38.960 --> 19:40.530
Nevermind.

19:45.290 --> 19:46.450
Nefakess?

19:47.080 --> 19:50.370
He was an esteemed retainer of Master Azra-Ael,
one of the eight Demon Lords.

19:50.370 --> 19:52.880
But even a thousand years ago I thought
there was something dubious about him.

19:52.880 --> 19:55.750
Yes. Tearis being revived was all part of his scheme,

19:55.750 --> 19:58.800
and it was only made worse
by that fake Roselia he somehow made...

19:59.330 --> 20:02.870
So the next time he appears we're going to twist
the bastard's arm until he coughs everything up.

20:03.390 --> 20:06.700
Milord. Please be wary of the Elf Hero, too.

20:07.460 --> 20:11.000
Oh right! What is she even doing in this era?

20:11.000 --> 20:12.600
Did she come here to defeat me?

20:12.600 --> 20:16.450
For the time being, Arle has been detained
in a room at the airport's medical facility.

20:17.650 --> 20:19.960
You must figure out what her objective is.

20:19.960 --> 20:21.570
As you command.

20:21.870 --> 20:26.790
By the way, milord. I noticed that you bestowed
the True Ancestor Dress to your new minion.

20:26.790 --> 20:28.240
What about it?

20:32.750 --> 20:34.040
You dumb Demon Lord.

20:34.040 --> 20:37.580
Hey! I heard that!
What the hell do you mean I'm "dumb"?!

20:37.580 --> 20:38.870
Hey, Leo?

20:39.380 --> 20:40.970
Did you say something?

20:45.710 --> 20:47.510
Jeez, Miss Selia!

20:47.960 --> 20:50.910
I've told you a million times,
please don't walk around like that!

20:51.480 --> 20:57.320
That dress left me feeling pretty wiped out...
so I can't wait any more.

20:58.370 --> 20:59.940
Pretty please?

20:59.940 --> 21:03.370
You can suck my blood, but do it slowly, okay?

21:03.370 --> 21:06.280
Don't worry, I promise I'll go easy this time!

21:07.280 --> 21:09.120
Just relax!

21:11.210 --> 21:13.490
Please put on some clothes...

21:15.040 --> 21:20.370
Well, we have the day off tomorrow.
Guess I'll make something sweet for the little guy!

21:20.840 --> 21:23.960
The stampede at the Seventh Assault Garden.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.670
The Hyperion incident.

21:25.670 --> 21:28.180
And the reboot of the Third Assault Garden.

21:28.180 --> 21:30.460
There must be a connection between them all.

21:30.460 --> 21:33.980
Maybe the key to that lies
in the Phillet Foundation's Artificial Elementals?

21:35.500 --> 21:36.750
This file...

21:36.750 --> 21:38.370
It has a really heavy layer of protection.

21:42.750 --> 21:44.210
Arle...

21:44.210 --> 21:46.910
She's a master of the sword in every sense.

21:47.370 --> 21:49.280
I'm going to have to train even harder.

21:52.040 --> 21:53.250
Where am I?

21:55.000 --> 22:00.490
The fact I haven't faded away...
means my mission isn't complete yet.

22:05.720 --> 22:08.070
An explosion at the sickbay in the airport?

22:12.430 --> 22:13.830
Good grief.

22:13.830 --> 22:17.290
My kingdom gets a little too rowdy at times.

22:17.290 --> 22:21.270
Well, I suppose I can let them have their fun
until I've claimed effective control.

22:22.000 --> 22:24.790
But it goes without saying I won't stop after that.

22:24.790 --> 22:27.700
Setting aside the fact I will eventually find Roselia,

22:27.700 --> 22:32.950
I intend to expand my territory more and more
until every last human empire belongs to me.

22:33.500 --> 22:36.080
I shall reestablish the Demon Lord army
and my kingdom,

22:36.080 --> 22:39.580
and make all the foolish humans bow at my feet.

22:49.040 --> 22:50.470
S-Sorry about that!

22:50.920 --> 22:53.260
You see? This is what happens when you get distracted!

22:54.370 --> 22:56.100
Where's your apology?

22:56.100 --> 22:57.820
I'm sorry...

23:01.000 --> 23:03.030
No worries. It's all okay.

23:16.370 --> 23:18.250
Sumoch food...

23:18.250 --> 23:19.620
Shary!

23:19.620 --> 23:21.370
What the hell happened to you?!

23:21.370 --> 23:23.370
Sumoch food...

23:23.370 --> 23:27.210
Damn! How could we have left her alone
until it got this bad?!

23:27.210 --> 23:29.250
Sumoch food...

23:29.250 --> 23:31.170
Stop! Enough eating!

23:31.170 --> 23:32.830
Sumoch food...

23:32.830 --> 23:34.310
No more!

23:36.540 --> 23:38.660
Ta-daaaa!

23:40.670 --> 23:42.280
Did I surprise you?

23:44.960 --> 23:48.210
Thank God... you're back to being the usual Shary.

23:48.210 --> 23:48.990
Yep!
